//
// Everything else follows from this:
//   - it is drawn (unlike a group) and hit on its own box, so clicking the
//     empty part of a frame selects the frame;
//   - its bounds are its own, never the union of the children (store/groups.ts::
//     contentWorldBounds descends to the children ONLY for groups);
//   - the click is NOT captured as by a group: the children of a frame are
//     selected directly, which is the artboard convention
